HST Office: Word-style Page Setup. The page has Margins, Paper and Layout tabs with the preview under them
on every tab, and in Writer's page style dialog the page comes first, followed by Header, Footer, Columns
and Borders; the fill pages, Footnote and the style organizer stay reachable after them.

- Only widget positions move in pageformatpage.ui (ids and types unchanged), so Calc and Impress get the
  same tabs. The orientation moved to Margins as in Word.
- SfxStyleDialogController::HstMoveOrganizerToEnd keeps the organizer's id; new styles still open on it.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
